      "content": "Absolutely, it's essential to comply with GDPR principles. For your small online stationery shop, you should ensure explicit consent is obtained before collecting or processing customers' email addresses and shipping info. Individuals must be informed about how their data will be used, and they should have the right to access, rectify, or erase their personal data. Clear and simple data privacy notices are also necessary. Moreover, you should have a solid data breach notification procedure in place. Keeping your customer data secure and respecting their privacy rights will help you maintain compliance with the GDPR.",
