      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one thing that worries me is data security—like, how do i make sure nothing 'sneaky' happens with the data behind the scenes? i dont want people accessing it without me knowing or having it leaked or something. what are the specific technical or organizational steps to prevent those kinds of hidden issues?",
